{"id":10821,"date":"2022-03-18T12:56:16","date_gmt":"2022-03-18T12:56:16","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=10821"},"modified":"2022-03-18T12:56:16","modified_gmt":"2022-03-18T12:56:16","slug":"analyza-piva-od-sladu-az-po-sklenici","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/analyza-piva-od-sladu-az-po-sklenici\/","title":{"rendered":"Anal\u00fdza piva: od sladu a\u017e po sklenici"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Pivo je v\u00a0na\u0161ich kon\u010din\u00e1ch nejobl\u00edben\u011bj\u0161\u00edm alkoholick\u00fdm n\u00e1pojem. Je pova\u017eov\u00e1no za jeden z\u00a0\u010desk\u00fdch symbol\u016f, a od roku 2008 je dokonce n\u00e1zev \u010cesk\u00e9 pivo chr\u00e1n\u011bn jako zem\u011bpisn\u00e9 ozna\u010den\u00ed. Jeho v\u00fdroba zahrnuje \u0159adu krok\u016f a s\u00a0n\u00e1roky na kvalitu jde ruku v\u00a0ruce i pot\u0159eba <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/potravinarstvi-zemedelstvi-a-krmiva\/\"><strong>spolehliv\u00e9 a rychl\u00e9 anal\u00fdzy samotn\u00e9ho n\u00e1poje i meziprodukt\u016f a vstupn\u00edch surovin<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>Jedn\u00edm z\u00a0nejelegantn\u011bj\u0161\u00edch zp\u016fsob\u016f anal\u00fdzy jsou bezesporu metody <strong>molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopie<\/strong>, zvl\u00e1\u0161t\u011b pak <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-is50\/\"><strong>FT-IR<\/strong><\/a> a <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/antaris-ii\/\"><strong>FT-NIR<\/strong><\/a> spektroskopie: infra\u010derven\u00e1 spektroskopie v\u00a0bl\u00edzk\u00e9 a st\u0159edn\u00ed oblasti. Tato m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed jsou rychl\u00e1, spolehliv\u00e1, automatizovateln\u00e1, bezkontaktn\u00ed a nen\u00ed pot\u0159eba vzorek jakkoli upravovat.<\/p>\n<p>V\u00fdsledek anal\u00fdzy z\u00edsk\u00e1te b\u011bhem n\u011bkolika des\u00edtek vte\u0159in, a to nejen v\u00a0laborato\u0159i, ale i <strong>p\u0159\u00edmo v\u00a0provozu \u010di ve skladu<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>Pokud ji\u017e jste na\u0161imi z\u00e1kazn\u00edky a chcete si prohloubit znalosti v\u00a0oboru molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopie, r\u00e1di v\u00e1s uvid\u00edme na na\u0161em tradi\u010dn\u00edm setk\u00e1n\u00ed <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/skoleni-a-kurzy\/\"><strong>Molekulov\u00e1 spektroskopie 2022<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Pivo je v\u00a0na\u0161ich kon\u010din\u00e1ch nejobl\u00edben\u011bj\u0161\u00edm alkoholick\u00fdm n\u00e1pojem. Je pova\u017eov\u00e1no za jeden z\u00a0\u010desk\u00fdch symbol\u016f, a od roku 2008 je dokonce n\u00e1zev \u010cesk\u00e9 pivo chr\u00e1n\u011bn jako zem\u011bpisn\u00e9 ozna\u010den\u00ed. Jeho v\u00fdroba zahrnuje \u0159adu krok\u016f a s\u00a0n\u00e1roky na kvalitu jde ruku v\u00a0ruce i pot\u0159eba spolehliv\u00e9 a rychl\u00e9 anal\u00fdzy samotn\u00e9ho n\u00e1poje i meziprodukt\u016f a vstupn\u00edch surovin. Jedn\u00edm z\u00a0nejelegantn\u011bj\u0161\u00edch zp\u016fsob\u016f anal\u00fdzy [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":10823,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[109,9],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-10821","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-109","category-novinky"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Anal\u00fdza piva: od sladu a\u017e po sklenici - Nicolet CZ<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/analyza-piva-od-sladu-az-po-sklenici\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"cs_CZ\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Anal\u00fdza piva: od sladu a\u017e po sklenici - Nicolet CZ\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Pi